  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Shantanu Narayen (born May 27, 1963) is an Indian-American business executive who has been the chairman, president, and chief executive officer (CEO) of Adobe Inc. since December 2007. Before this, he was the company's president and chief operating officer since 2005.\nNarayen is a member of The Business Council.",
